{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1795193392","published":"2026-11-20T16:50:05Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:27.947591391Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-2296","CVE-2026-97631"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2025-2296, CVE-2026-97631","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: Secure Boot bypass via the legacy Linux kernel loader\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-2296.patch: make the fallback to the legacy\n       Linux kernel loader in X86QemuLoadImageLib configurable via the\n       opt/org.tianocore/EnableLegacyLoader fw_cfg option and warn when\n       Secure Boot verification of the kernel fails.\n     - CVE-2025-2296\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: PXE ICMP error buffer overflow\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-97631.patch: clear the ICMP error buffer and\n       truncate ICMP/ICMPv6 error fragments at the end of the buffer in\n       NetworkPkg/UefiPxeBcDxe/PxeBcSupport.c.\n     - CVE-2026-97631\n   * Build the firmware reproducibly, through a fixed build path, on amd64\n     only; arm64 and armel install the same images from debian/prebuilt,\n     because the vendor packaging cannot build them there. amd64 verifies\n     that debian/prebuilt equals what it built; arm64 and armel fail when\n     debian/prebuilt is older than debian/.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ovmf","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/ovmf?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2020.11-2+deb11u3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1795193392.json"}},{"package":{"name":"ovmf-ia32","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/ovmf-ia32?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2020.11-2+deb11u3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1795193392.json"}},{"package":{"name":"qemu-efi","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/qemu-efi?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2020.11-2+deb11u3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1795193392.json"}},{"package":{"name":"qemu-efi-aarch64","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/qemu-efi-aarch64?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2020.11-2+deb11u3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1795193392.json"}},{"package":{"name":"qemu-efi-arm","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/qemu-efi-arm?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2020.11-2+deb11u3+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1795193392.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.tuxcare.com/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1795193392.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-2296"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-97631"}]}